# Task B: cost of bounds

Compiler `3ebe0558f25592a0c1f8b6cf9bf7ad09f3ddb1d1`; acceptance membership is the supplied remote `accepted_correct` account (older compiler), not a new acceptance run. All 214 accepted entry functions compile on the final compiler.

**Result:** 36 programs contain bounded runtime-shaped source array values (131 expression-result array occurrences). The equal-program capacity/actual geometric mean is **∞**, because two programs contain empty arrays on both fixtures. Over the 34 programs with no empty measured array it is **2.16556×**, median **1.86898×**. Sound checked shape-control specialization was measured for **17 programs**: default/specialized Halo2 cells have geometric mean **3.66497×** (range 1.04579–11.3009×); Noir gates **1.5858×** (range 1.01358–10.4513×). These circuit ratios include savings from knowing shape-control values; they are not an isolated padding-only causal effect.

